<title>GERMANY: Kaufhalle again without dividend.</title>
<headline>Kaufhalle again without dividend.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Parent sales			   2,231	 vs 2,306</p>
<p>    Parent investment			 47	 vs 54</p>
<p>    Parent DVFA cash flow		    9	 vs 35</p>
<p>    Parent profit from ord. activities   7	 vs 8</p>
<p>    Parent net profit			0.4	 vs 0.2</p>
<p>    DVFA earnings per share     loss 10.61	 vs 0.18 marks</p>
<p>    Dividend				     0	 vs 0 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German retail group is Kaufhalle AG. The company is controlled by Metro AG.</p>
<p>-- Douglas Busvine, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
